    "title": "Editorial: Reducing the cost of housing in Nassau County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Long Island Press ,\n1 days ago New York took a step forward in addressing the cost of housing on Long Island and across the state last week when it approved revisions to the State Environmental Quality Review Act intended to expedite the review process for housing and certain infrastructure projects when there are “no significant environmental impacts.” Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
